From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Subject: [PATCH] urltest: ordered reserve members for the Podkop profile

Adapted from podkop-engine commit c89d4587dc22b6668e88061eb169ae4d98a1a153
(GPL-3.0-or-later). Primary members win over reserves; reserves are chosen
in list order and a recovered primary wins again. Retain lx lifecycle,
reachability and reactive dial machinery. No option means original lx.

---
